                    <p class=\"card-text\">Generate Binomial, Permutation, or Combination circuits with your parameters.</p>\\n\
                    <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\\n\
                  </div>\\n\
                </div>\\n\
            </div>\\n\
        </div>\\n\
        <br/>\\n\
        <h4>Original CHIMera System Demos (Legacy)</h4>\\n\
        <p>These are from the original IoT project and may not reflect the current Quantum Explorer focus.</p>\\n\
        <div class=\"row mt-3 align-items-stretch\">\"\"\"+\\n\
            get_circuit_selection_html('empty', 3) +\\n\
            get_circuit_selection_html('anything', 3) +\\n\
            get_circuit_selection_html('cappucino', 3) +\\n\
            get_circuit_selection_html('withoutcoffein', 3) \\n\
        +\"\"\"</div>\\n\
        <br/>\\n\
        <h4>Explore Quantum Algorithms</h4>\\n\
        <div class=\"row mt-3 align-items-stretch\">\\n\
            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\\n\
                <div class=\"card\" data-rh-exec="load_combinatorial_circuit('dj_n1_const0')">\\n\
                  <div class=\"card-body\">\\n\
                    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Deutsch-Jozsa (n=1, Constant Zero)</h5>\\n\
                    <p class=\"card-text\">Distinguish constant from balanced functions.</p>\\n\
                    <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\\n\
                  </div>\\n\
                </div>\\n\
            </div>\\n\
            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\\n\
                <div class=\"card\" data-rh-exec="load_combinatorial_circuit('dj_n1_balanced_pattern1')">\\n\
                  <div class=\"card-body\">\\n\
                    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Deutsch-Jozsa (n=1, Balanced f(x)=x)</h5>\\n\
                    <p class=\"card-text\">Distinguish constant from balanced functions.</p>\\n\
                    <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\\n\
                  </div>\\n\
                </div>\\n\
            </div>\\n\
            <div class=\"col-md-4\">\\n\
                <div class=\"card\" data-rh-exec="load_combinatorial_circuit('dj_n2_balanced_pattern1')">\\n\
                  <div class=\"card-body\">\\n\
                    <h5 class=\"card-title\">Deutsch-Jozsa (n=2, Balanced f(x)=x0^x1)</h5>\\n\
                    <p class=\"card-text\">Distinguish constant from balanced functions.</p>\\n\
                    <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\\n\
                  </div>\\n\
                </div>\\n\
            </div>\\n\
        </div>\\n\
    </div>\\n\
\"\"\")\n",
    "\n",
    "view_welcome_content.load_css(\"./css/view_welcome.css\")"
   ]
